cohort_provenance.verbatim_source:
Having armed yourselves strongly with the weapon of Christ, and clad yourselves in the armor of faith, ye cast down the hosts of the enemy, O sufferers;

**Column B**
for fervently, through the hope of life, ye endured all the threats and wounds of the torturers; therefore ye also received crowns, O long-suffering martyrs of Christ.

